@startuml
title Healthcare Portal — Polished Requirement Specification

state PortalChoice1 <<choice>>
state PortalChoice2 <<choice>>
state PortalChoice3 <<choice>>
state ServiceJoin <<choice>>
state OwnerJoin <<choice>>
state RegistrationFailed <<choice>>
state LoginFailed <<choice>>
state LoggedIn <<choice>>
state ServiceCenterRegistration
state ServiceCenterVerification
state ServiceCenterLogin
state ServiceCenterHome
state ExpiryNotification
state DamagedParts
state UpdatingParts
state Logout
state PaymentMethodSelection
state InsurancePaymentDetails
state CashPaymentDetails
state FeedbackCollection
state SessionEnded

[*] --> PortalChoice1

PortalChoice1 --> PortalChoice2 : [Service Center Portal]
PortalChoice1 --> PortalChoice3 : [Car Owner Portal]

PortalChoice2 --> ServiceCenterRegistration : [New Service Center]
PortalChoice2 --> RegistrationFailed : [Registration Fails]
PortalChoice3 --> CarOwnerRegistration : [New Car Owner]
PortalChoice3 --> LoginFailed : [Login Fails]

ServiceCenterRegistration --> ServiceCenterVerification : [Credentials Validated]
ServiceCenterVerification --> ServiceCenterLogin : [Verified Successfully]
ServiceCenterVerification --> RegistrationFailed : [Verification Failed]

ServiceCenterLogin --> LoggedIn : [Logged In Successfully]
ServiceCenterLogin --> LoginFailed : [Authentication Fails]

LoggedIn --> ServiceCenterHome : [Enter Damaged parts list or Expiry Notification page or Updating Information list]
LoggedIn --> PaymentMethodSelection : [Select payment method for drug and supplement purchases]

ExpiryNotification --> ServiceCenterHome : [Return to Service center home page]
ExpiryNotification --> FeedbackCollection : [Send service request to Car owner]

DamagedParts --> ServiceCenterHome : [Return to Service center home page]

UpdatingParts --> ServiceCenterHome : [Return to Service center home page]

Logout --> SessionEnded : [Logged out Successfully]

ServiceCenterHome --> DamagedParts : [Enter damaged parts list]
ServiceCenterHome --> ExpiryNotification : [View expiry notification]
ServiceCenterHome --> UpdatingParts : [Update changed parts information]
ServiceCenterHome --> PaymentMethodSelection : [Select payment method for doctor consultations]

PaymentMethodSelection --> CashPaymentDetails : [Cash payment details]
PaymentMethodSelection --> InsurancePaymentDetails : [Insurance-based payments]

@enduml
